WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT

This licence covers the GuideComposer source code and documentation in this
repository. Two things shipped alongside it are not ours to license, and two
things sold separately are not covered by it.

Third-party code in the package. `client/vendor/CSInterface.js` is Adobe's and
is used under Adobe's own terms; `host/vendor/json2.js` is public domain. Both
carry their authors' notices, which must not be removed. See NOTICE.

The Adobe application itself. GuideComposer is a plugin. It needs your own
licensed copy of Adobe Illustrator, which this licence does not provide and has
nothing to do with.

Separately sold materials. Preset packs, template files, guides and tutorials
sold as the Supporter Pack are not part of this repository and are not licensed
under the MIT licence. Their terms are in TERMS.md.

The name and the logo. MIT grants rights to the code, not to the name
"GuideComposer" or to the panel icons as a mark of origin. You may fork this
code and sell your fork; please do it under your own name, so users can tell
which one they are installing and know whom to ask for support.
